    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Measure parent and daughter diameters and branch angles in segmented arterial trees, then regress angle on relative branch caliber and test symmetry for equal daughters. A flat or reversed relationship would refute the rule.";
